abstract: >
  GFSFUI — General Framework of Structural Folding and Unfolding Intelligence —
  is a general research and engineering framework for organizing intelligence
  around the continuous movement between concrete experience and reusable
  structural knowledge. The framework connects Generic Structural
  Representation, Structural Folding, Metric Differential structures,
  Cluster-Central CCCs, Core and Delta, Per-Node Intelligence, Structural
  Search, Two-Way Search, Counter-Evidence, Structural Falsification,
  sparse-data structural learning, Structural Unfolding, CallingGraph
  generation, Local UTN, context-preserving identity, validation,
  certification, continual structural growth, and Refolding.

